 "_about": "even_rule_check.py (branch even-rule, 2026-10-14): why N wobbled, the wobble measure, and the rule R (CC11 cancels the repeatable part of each slur's loudness swell at the strength that minimises Zwicker's fluctuation strength summed over the critical bands). SSO Celli - Performance, CC1 64, the tempo-line passages (136 / 180 / 250 ms, R repeating figure, L line). Renders: Windows test VM, kthost + Kontakt 8 + SSO, MuseScore's resaved setup. wobble: the heard mp3s of db evenwindow1 (pass 1). sim: audio-domain simulation on held-out uncorrected plays (CC11 as a broadband gain, calibration). real: every pass of every render, R = the rule rendered. Measures: swellP75 (dB, the perceived envelope's largest rise per note, p75), fsLow / fsHigh / fs (fluctuation strength, vacil-scaled index: 0-12 / 12-24 / 0-24 Bark), pos (swell by slur position, R passages)."
